cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this knowledge base in teaching or research, please cite it as below."
title: "Microbial Bioinformatics Pipeline Guidebook"
abstract: >-
  An offline-first, data-driven knowledge base for microbial bioinformatics:
  an interactive pipeline builder with 160 typed modules and 12 end-to-end
  workflows, plus a 12-chapter Chinese-language field guide. The panel, the
  generated tool index and the exports are all derived from the same data
  registry, so documentation and behaviour cannot drift apart.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Indigo-Rain"
